  "description": "纯 C# 封装（Source-Generated COM + P/Invoke，无第三方依赖）的 7-Zip 读写库，覆盖\n      7z / zip / tar / tar.gz 四种格式（含分卷、7z/zip 密码），跨平台支持 Windows /\n      Linux / Android。内部通过官方未修改的 7-Zip 原生库（LGPL-2.1）完成实际编解码，\n      详见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。\n\n      A pure C# wrapper (source-generated COM + P/Invoke, no third-party managed\n      dependencies) around 7-Zip, supporting 7z / zip / tar / tar.gz (including\n      multi-volume archives and 7z/zip passwords), cross-platform on Windows / Linux /\n      Android. Actual encoding/decoding is performed by the unmodified official 7-Zip\n      native library (LGPL-2.1) — see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.",
